# GitHub

- CI is `.github/workflows/cy.yml`. Release is `.github/workflows/release.yml`. **Keep them separate.**
- Do not collapse CI and release into one workflow.
- Do not add extra workflows unless asked.
- These files are empty scaffold. When filling, keep verify/build in `cy.yml` and version/publish/NSIS in `release.yml`.
- Windows-first suite: do not assume Linux WebView2/NSIS in CI unless the workflow already says so.
- Do not put secrets in workflow files. Use GitHub Actions secrets.
